  { -- Npc
    'Kharan Feromalho‡Каран Могучий Молот‡Kharan Mighthammer‡카란 마이트해머‡Kharan Martillazo‡Kharan Martillazo‡Kharan Mighthammer‡卡兰·巨锤‡卡蘭·巨錘',
